        <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;Medical Scribe (HLS) – OEP audio-analyzer integration and DL Streamer plan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Native workers started by the Next.js app (no containers) · Phase 1: audio-analyzer as default STT · Phase 2: optional DL Streamer STT backend · Phase 3: video (future)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1">
